Package: fosos-desktop
Version: 0.1.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-wnck-3.0, python3-xlib, openbox, xfce4-settings, xfce4-terminal, thunar, network-manager, network-manager-gnome, wireplumber, fonts-inter, greybird-gtk-theme, adwaita-icon-theme, fosos-theme
Maintainer: FosOS <dev@fosos.local>
Description: FosOS Desktop session, experimental
 The FosOS panel, Start menu, desktop, notifications and settings shell,
 running on the Openbox window manager. It is registered as a separate
 login session. XFCE remains the default session and the fallback on the
 login screen.
